      166         x_parts.fact-date FORMAT "99/99/99":U
      167       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 95.5 BY 16.79 FIT-LAST-COLUMN.
      168   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      169        BROWSE-2 AT ROW 3.67 COL 1.5 WIDGET-ID 200
