      175        B-lkp AT ROW 2.63 COL 11.63 WIDGET-ID 6
      176        B-lkp-In AT ROW 2.63 COL 24.75 WIDGET-ID 8
      177        SPACE(66.25) SKIP(19.03)
      178       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      179            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      180            TITLE "Корректировка партий внешнего прихода закрытого на факт"
      181            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-exit CANCEL-BUTTON B-Cancel WIDGET-ID 100.
      182   ASSIGN
